WEBVTT

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:19.100
Junk Warrior attacks Infernity Destroyer!

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:25.070
Kiryu!

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:32.080
If my monster is destroyed in battle 
when I have no cards in my hand...

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:37.110
I can Special Summon Infernity Avenger 
from my graveyard in defense position.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:44.090
When this effect summons Infernity Avenger, its 
Level becomes the same as the destroyed monster.

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:45.020
What?

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:48.090
Infernity Destroyer's Level was 6.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:57.400
900 life points.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:02.370
Just a little more and I'll be dead.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:07.280
Yusei, I'm satisfied because 
you're my opponent.

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:08.490
You're wrong!

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:11.150
There's no way that you're satisfied!

00:01:11.570 --> 00:01:13.290
It can't be helped.

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:16.620
I can't betray you or dueling.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:24.450
Therefore, I'll have my teammate 
and friend finish me in a duel.

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.450
That will have to satisfy me.

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:29.420
Kiryu...

00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:32.430
You'll lose?

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:38.760
Don't forget that your Duel Disk is rigged.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:44.030
If you try anything suspicious, your Duel 
Disk will blow up, along with your arm.

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:45.950
How dare you!

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:11.340
Every time you're hurt, you can become kinder

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:16.880
Stand up and you'll understand strength

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:21.460
Don't look back and keep going

00:02:21.460 --> 00:02:27.120
Both the past and the future 
are connected to the present

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:32.160
There's no need to fear

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:39.800
I'll keep telling you that you're not alone

00:02:40.670 --> 00:02:45.940
The passionate emotions in your heart

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:51.580
Streak to the infinite future

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:57.170
Dreams surpass their limits

00:02:57.170 --> 00:03:05.090
And will lead you to a bright place

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:37.020
The Trap After Victory

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.770
What's going on?

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:51.070
Say something, master!

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:56.500
I told you that I won't lose on purpose.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:59.170
In fact, I can't lose on purpose.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:02.820
The duel and the cards are possessing me.

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.870
They won't allow it.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:10.390
In order to escape from this hell, I have 
to battle Yusei with all my strength.

00:04:10.390 --> 00:04:14.330
I just hope that will set me free.

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:17.180
That means you want to lose!

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:18.490
Exactly.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:23.470
But for some reason, I'm still 
here because I keep winning.

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:24.270
What?

00:04:25.300 --> 00:04:27.660
That's why the master is the master.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.620
He wouldn't be undefeated if he wasn't crazy.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.210
Sorry, master.

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:34.180
What's taking so long?

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:35.440
Continue the duel!

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.080
Kiryu...

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:41.160
My turn.

00:04:41.160 --> 00:04:44.190
I summon Infernity Dwarf.

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:52.230
Level 6 Infernity Avenger 
tunes Level 2 Infernity Dwarf.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:55.960
When the living and the dead merge at zero,

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:58.770
the evil dragon escapes 
from its eternal prison.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.000
Synchro Summon!

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.980
Come, Infernity Doom Dragon!

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:10.710
I've never seen this dragon before!

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:14.830
When I have zero cards in my hand, I 
can choose not to battle once per turn.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:21.210
One monster on your field is destroyed, and 
you take damage equal to half its attack points.

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.390
Infernity Death Breath!

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:32.360
I end my turn.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.540
The master is taking this duel seriously!

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.420
My turn!

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:49.450
I destroy the set trap card Limiter Overload 
to Special Summon Card Breaker from my hand!

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:56.290
Since Limiter Overload was 
destroyed, its effect activates!

00:05:56.920 --> 00:05:59.640
I Special Summon Speed 
Warrior from my graveyard!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:07.870
I release the Warrior-Type Speed Warrior to 
Special Summon Turret Warrior from my hand!

00:06:11.060 --> 00:06:17.480
Level 1 Boost Warrior tunes Level 2 Card 
Breaker and Level 5 Turret Warrior!

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:22.180
The wishes come together 
to form a new shining star!

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:23.860
Become the path that lights the way!

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.750
Synchro Summon!

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:28.860
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:37.260
See that?  Our master also 
has an incredible monster!

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:41.500
But Master Kiryu's dragon 
has higher attack points!

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:47.720
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:48.860 --> 00:06:50.140
My turn.

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:52.180
I set one card.

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:58.960
Infernity Doom Dragon 
attacks Stardust Dragon.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.760
Death Fire Blast!

00:07:02.390 --> 00:07:05.290
I flip over my Continuous Trap Power Frame!

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:09.690
When I take an attack from your 
monster, that battle is negated!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:13.710
Next, Power Frame equips 
on to Stardust Dragon.

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:17.550
It gains attack points equal to the 
difference between Stardust Dragon

00:07:17.550 --> 00:07:19.470
and your negated monster's attack points!

00:07:19.470 --> 00:07:24.040
Stardust Dragon and Infernity Doom Dragon's 
attack points differ by 500 points!

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:28.650
Their attack points are now equal!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:35.450
Yusei is also serious.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:37.850
I end my turn.

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:39.530
My turn!

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.090
I summon Second Booster!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:48.800
Stardust Dragon attacks 
Infernity Doom Dragon!

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.730
This is bad!

00:07:52.730 --> 00:07:54.510
Mutual destruction will empty his field,

00:07:54.510 --> 00:07:57.140
so Yusei can then attack him 
directly with Second Booster!

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:01.210
Shooting Sonic!

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:04.310
I flip over my trap card Infernity Break.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:06.570
When I have zero cards in my hand,

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:09.480
I can remove an Infernity card 
in my graveyard from play

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:12.420
to destroy a card on your field.

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.660
I destroy Power Frame.

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:18.870
Stardust Dragon's attack points 
return to their original points.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:26.570
This is my full strength.

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:28.270
Whatever's next...

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:31.070
Second Booster's effect activates!

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:34.010
If my monster's attack points change,

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:40.210
I can release Second Booster to increase 
that monster's attack points by 1500!

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:42.080
You can do that?

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.500
Yusei!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.460
Go, Stardust Dragon!

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.930
Shooting Sonic!

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:05.400
Good.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:08.650
I'm finally free from dueling.

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:18.460
When he loses and is free of Ramon's 
control, that's our chance.

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:23.220
We'll grab him before those 
men take him to the mountain.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.330
Barbara!

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.980
Barbara...

00:09:52.040 --> 00:09:54.310
Why?

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:25.350
Since I shot you with this shock 
gun, you can't move for awhile.

00:10:54.520 --> 00:10:56.780
Who's that?

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:08.490
He's...

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:22.300
You're Malcolm's younger brother.

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:24.040
Lotten!

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:32.980
Wait!

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:37.920
There's someone you need to take with you.

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.260
Let's duel!

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:48.490
Whatever!  The sun is about to set!

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:49.860
Duel time is over!

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.670
If I get one turn, that's plenty.

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:53.570
What?

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:55.540
Just one turn?

00:11:55.850 --> 00:11:57.690
I challenged you to a duel.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.300
Are you going to chicken out?

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:12.850
I drew first, so I get to go first.

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:14.420
My turn!

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:16.960
I summon Gatling Ogre!

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:27.870
Then I set five cards.

00:12:32.210 --> 00:12:33.680
Are you stupid?

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:36.880
The player who goes first can't 
attack on the first turn!

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.640
You'll beat me in one turn?

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:40.580
You're an amateur who doesn't know the rules!

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:42.200
No, that would be you.

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:43.650
Fire!

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:48.090
This isn't an attack.

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:53.590
Due to Gatling Ogre's effect, you take 
800 points of damage for every card

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:57.880
in my Spell and Trap Card Zone 
that I send to the graveyard.

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:05.130
That's dirty.

00:13:05.700 --> 00:13:08.110
How could I have stopped that?

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.210
He won in one turn!

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:29.680
If any of you have the 
guts, I'll take you on!

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:36.910
But if you want to look stylish, 
I'll wrap a scarf around your neck.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:47.510
Sorry, master.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:53.980
My brother came home from training and 
created a plan to take over this town instantly.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:59.580
But to pull it off, we had 
to defeat Kiryu first.

00:13:59.580 --> 00:14:03.290
Lotten could've handled it, but 
it's better to save your ace.

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:09.070
That's why I invited Yusei Fudo, 
Kiryu's friend from Satis-whatever.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:12.900
I thought you cared about Kiryu!

00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:16.240
Why would I care about a dead man?

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:20.030
I like men who are powerful.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:28.590
But you're not bad yourself.  You fought 
hard for a guy who just wouldn't die.

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:32.390
If you'll be my slave, I'll put a 
good word in for you with Malcolm.

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:34.390
I refuse!

00:14:39.990 --> 00:14:41.230
Bye.

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.230
Enjoy your trip to hell, Yusei Fudo.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:03.980
The Malcolm Family now rules this town!

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:11.180
Starting tomorrow, all duels are under 
the Malcolm Family's jurisdiction!

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.690
Kiryu...

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.020
Nico.

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:39.190
It's pointless to think about escaping.

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:46.330
That necklace will punish you 
by emitting lots of electricity.

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.270
It's all your fault!

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:01.160
If you didn't lose, this 
wouldn't have happened!

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:03.120
Stop it!  Get away from him!

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:06.410
Say something!  It's all your fault!

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:09.150
You sent a lot of people here too!

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:14.080
But starting today, that town belongs to us.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:14.890
Let's go!

00:16:14.890 --> 00:16:16.560
You're coming too!

00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:20.920
Welcome to the workplace from hell.

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:25.920
This place is...

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:43.200
Stop slacking off!

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:49.450
You'll work in this group.

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:50.700
It's a simple job.

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:52.520
Dig up Dyne!

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:54.420
Just keep digging!

00:16:55.110 --> 00:16:56.310
Start!

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:01.750
Kiryu.

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:09.360
Kiryu!

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:11.040
What are you standing around for?

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:12.140
Start working!

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:17.430
Kiryu...

00:17:43.010 --> 00:17:45.240
Stop staggering!

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:46.760
Kiryu!

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:54.250
Stop resting!

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:15.500
It's finally time for a shift change.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:18.090
It's hard to breathe in here.

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:20.700
We're not ants.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.280
Anything out of the ordinary?

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.530
Are you okay?

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:40.430
Out of the way!

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:41.560
Move!

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:44.200
Wake up!

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:54.390
Don't do it.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:59.010
Did he collapse from exhaustion?

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:00.670
That makes how many today?

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:03.240
What's going to happen to him?

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:07.180
Who knows.  There are no hospitals in hell.

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:10.180
They use dueling to do horrible things!

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:12.240
You're a fool.

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:16.160
You followed me to hell to save me.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:19.070
I don't intend to stay here.

00:19:19.070 --> 00:19:21.430
We're going to escape together.

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:36.180
As usual, you're skilled with machines.

00:19:37.430 --> 00:19:39.680
When the guards change 
shifts, that's our chance.

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:43.720
I found an unused tunnel behind that machine.

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:45.420
We'll sneak inside and search for an exit.

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:49.550
Kiryu.

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:51.600
Escape alone.

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:53.510
I'm staying here.

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:55.900
I came here to rescue you!

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:58.270
You've already saved me.

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:01.270
You buried me and my dueling.

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:05.380
Kiryu, I won't let that satisfy you!

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:26.480
You did well, Barbara.

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:29.580
This town finally belongs to you.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.570
No, it belongs to you.

00:20:32.470 --> 00:20:35.540
This town will now be named Barbara Town.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:37.510
That makes me happy!

00:20:37.510 --> 00:20:40.270
And the ore will be called Barbara Ore!

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:42.330
I'm so happy!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:02.900
Hey!

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:08.480
Didn't we put Yusei Fudo's 
D-Wheel over there?

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:10.370
I don't remember.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.780
Hmm...

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:22.070
Just in case, I'll finish them.

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:25.880
Kiryu.

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:28.250
Leave me alone.

00:21:29.170 --> 00:21:31.820
I died.

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:38.870
I won't let you die.

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:43.160
Even if I die, I'm bringing you home.

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:14.250
The small cliff floats on the Milky Way

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:19.130
The sights I see are different 
than what I imagined

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:24.070
Were you able to move on from the past?

00:22:24.070 --> 00:22:29.080
The answer isn't no, but 
there's something missing

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:34.130
The cruel god tests us

00:22:34.130 --> 00:22:40.690
Let's fill the emptiness 
and head to the next stage

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:44.760
If you ask me "What's our relationship?"

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:50.600
We're more than friends... 
but that's not quite right

00:22:50.600 --> 00:22:54.690
Bond is the proper word

00:22:54.690 --> 00:23:00.310
As we fight, we understand each other

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:03.490
"Where are you right now?"  "On Earth"

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:05.750
Because I'm not an astronaut

00:23:05.750 --> 00:23:10.280
I have no problems when 
I'm below the ozone layer

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:13.250
"I know, I'm coming right away."

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:16.690
You want to party until the morning

00:23:16.690 --> 00:23:20.070
At our special place
